  <data name="AboutDescription" xml:space="preserve"><value>Bridge unifies your games — from external libraries, manual entries and emulated ROMs — into one fast, local, self-contained catalog. Incremental import, local metadata, fast virtualized views and emulation support, without a plugin runtime or a separate fullscreen frontend. Playnite is an inspiration, not a specification: Bridge's structure, architecture and implementation are its own.</value></data>
